        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gravel, crushed, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gravel, crushed, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: 1d5b4602-52cb-388e-87df-703f4eb37e6f
This data set accounts for 1 kg of gravel at the regional storage. 19% are from import, 81% are produced in Switzerland. The imported goods are delievered to Switzerland to 36% from Germany, 26% from Italy 23% from France and 14% from Austria. 13% are delievered by freight train, 78% by lorry and 8% by barge.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of gravel and sand: 44'510 kt
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1d5b4602-52cb-388e-87df-703f4eb37e6f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
